**additional view = the view that is displayed under the cc when it is in its smaller size

priorities:
1 - least priority
10 - most priority


Bugs:
- fix not all notifications showing until you start to scroll (8)
- screen recording module not syncing across different cc's (4)
- fix animations in cc //animations aren't awful, but they're not ideal atm (1)
- fix suggested app view's size getting messed up & getting covered by the additional view (4)

Features:
- show ls music player in additional view area (6)
- horizontal scroll view to switch between additional views (7)
- option to constantly have scroll view in miniature size (7)
- custom control center different from the normal one (select whichever modules you want to show respectively from the main cc) (9)
- better preferences with more organization, an obwelcomecontroller, etc. (5)
- show floaty dock in switcher view (1)
- show/hide no older notification text (2)
- automatically scroll to the first app that has notifications
- change additional view if there are no notifications or no music playing (4)
- make sure most if not all options can be applied without the use of a respring, besides enabling/disabling the tweak ofc (10)
- show notification badge in header view of app page view (4)


